; ============================================================
; THE BYZANTINE SHADOW
; MODULE 01 -- CONSTANTS
; ============================================================
;
; Purpose:
;   Central registry for the Shadow-derived control vocabulary.
;
; Authority model:
;   This file declares names and immutable values only.
;   It does not make decisions, mutate world state, execute
;   commands, reserve resources, or verify outcomes.
;
; Provenance:
;   Primary behavioral source: Shadow DC7 / SourceShaRef.
;   Values below are preserved where directly evidenced in the
;   supplied Shadow source. Experimental/legacy values remain
;   explicitly marked rather than silently promoted to behavior.
;
; IMPORTANT:
;   Numeric goal IDs are engine-global.
;   Shadow source explicitly uses goals 478 and 479 for home-x/home-y.
;   Legacy transaction aliases therefore MUST NOT occupy those IDs.
; ============================================================

